+# W3b source readiness — 2026-11-03
+
+The external-review repair adds the remaining isolation-aware consumers: JunkieJarvis, its nightly suggestions tenant, live mirror, gateway, and Dream governance/digest. With the boot flag on they request purpose-bound operations and never fall back to a local key reader on refusal. Flag-off compatibility retains the existing local paths. This is source readiness, not a flag-on or deployed custody result; this ADR's adoption statuses remain unchanged.
+
+The closed port now admits bounded NIP-17 wrap/open, authenticated forum grant open, fixed kind-42 zone sealing, mirror self-wrap and a separate `governance_event`. These use maintained `nostr-bbs-core` NIP-44/NIP-59/signing primitives and the existing receipt-before-return boundary. Callers cannot supply a generic signing kind through DM/zone operations. Outer recipients must identify the held key exactly once; bodies are capped at 16 KiB. Mirror lookup is public-only: legacy `secret: true` ACLs now fail validation and must migrate to `mirror_wrap`.
+
+The independently marked, optional `agent_governance` key can author 31400/31402 and its own kind-5 withdrawals, plus public-key lookup and allowlisted NIP-42 authentication. It cannot sign as JunkieJarvis or author human decisions (31401, 31403–31405, 38414). The same devuser UID holds both capabilities, so the dedicated operation enforces purpose/key selection rather than claiming isolation between same-UID callers. The gateway's fixed legacy child derivation stays inside custody; arbitrary caller-selected derivation tags remain refused under isolation.
+
+Operator steps remain: independently provision `DREAM_GOVERNANCE_PRIVKEY_HEX` into identity-role delivery, admit its public identity and governance role at the forum, rebuild with matching pinned forum/Solid source and lockfiles, and run the full flag-on boot rehearsal. Browser key minting, historical secret purging, host Docker permissions and activation are separate outstanding custody boundaries. No key was minted, read from a live role secret, or changed by this repair.
+
+Validation: bridge library 108 tests, Dream host 191 tests, 105 focused JavaScript regressions and four bounded-client Node tests passed during development; both Rust crates passed all-target Clippy with warnings denied. These source gates do not establish a live forum ceremony, receipt filesystem ownership or a rebuilt image. Exact fetched-source validation is required before the coordinated dependency pins are accepted.
